{"id": "sfo-airtrain-settlement-renewal", "title": "How a train collision shaped two decades of AirTrain contracting", "seconds": 72.5, "voice": "elevenlabs:9PVP7ENhDskL0KYHAKtD", "narrator": "Jerry B.", "tempo": 1.12, "made": "2026-11-26", "key": "4f2941111493e3f2", "words": 231, "beats": [{"scene": "settlement", "kind": "hook", "ref": ["suspicious[0]", "established[0]"], "text": "A 2002 AirTrain testing accident led to litigation at San Francisco International Airport.", "t0": 0.2, "t1": 4.8, "shot": "r0", "visual": {"type": "hook", "words": ["How", "did", "a", "settlement", "determine", "who", "operated", "AirTrain?"], "sub": "San Francisco International Airport"}, "wt": [0.0, 0.11, 0.3, 0.65, 0.86, 1.26, 1.6, 1.99, 2.15, 2.24, 2.8, 2.93, 3.13, 3.64, 4.17]}, {"scene": "settlement", "kind": "quote", "ref": ["suspicious[0]", "established[0]"], "text": "This is a lead, not a finding.", "t0": 4.92, "t1": 6.49, "shot": "r1", "visual": {"type": "quote", "line": "A lead, not a finding"}, "wt": [0.0, 0.16, 0.29, 0.38, 0.92, 1.11, 1.18]}, {"scene": "settlement", "kind": "doc", "ref": ["suspicious[0]", "established[0]"], "text": "The 2008 settlement gave Bombardier a five-year operating and maintenance contract without competitive bidding.", "t0": 6.61, "t1": 11.5, "shot": "r2", "visual": {"type": "doc", "source": "ordinance", "kicker": "San Francisco Board of Supervisors", "text": "2008 settlement", "mark": "2008 settlement"}, "wt": [0.0, 0.1, 0.28, 0.61, 0.77, 1.15, 1.37, 1.89, 1.97, 2.44, 2.88, 2.97, 3.33, 3.83, 4.12, 4.57]}, {"scene": "settlement", "kind": "bignum", "ref": ["suspicious[0]", "established[0]"], "text": "The initial contract was $56.5 million. The airport had to extend it three years if Bombardier met the performance benchmarks.", "t0": 11.62, "t1": 18.51, "shot": "r3", "visual": {"type": "bignum", "value": "$56.5 million", "label": "Initial five-year contract"}, "wt": [0.0, 0.12, 0.43, 0.91, 1.05, 1.55, 1.8, 2.11, 2.42, 3.22, 3.36, 3.72, 3.88, 4.01, 4.38, 4.48, 4.76, 5.02, 5.13, 5.65, 5.82, 5.92, 6.37]}, {"scene": "modification", "kind": "record", "ref": ["suspicious[1]", "established[1]"], "text": "In 2013, the contract modification was $42.2 million.", "t0": 18.73, "t1": 22.75, "shot": "r4", "visual": {"type": "record", "layout": "amounts", "context": "2013 modification", "heading": "New service and a prior shortfall", "source": "analyst", "rows": [{"icon": "contract", "label": "Three years of service", "value": "$39 million"}, {"icon": "money", "label": "Shortfall in the previous term", "value": "$3.2 million"}]}, "wt": [0.0, 0.13, 0.41, 1.05, 1.2, 1.61, 2.23, 2.38, 2.89, 3.12, 3.32, 3.62]}, {"scene": "modification", "kind": "quote", "ref": ["suspicious[1]", "established[1]"], "text": "That included $3.2 million for a budget shortfall in the previous term.", "t0": 22.87, "t1": 26.58, "shot": "r5", "visual": {"type": "quote", "line": "Prior term"}, "wt": [0.0, 0.16, 0.57, 0.81, 1.05, 1.28, 1.6, 1.9, 2.05, 2.13, 2.42, 2.85, 2.93, 3.02, 3.41]}, {"scene": "modification", "kind": "doc", "ref": ["suspicious[1]", "established[1]"], "text": "The shortfall included change orders and escalation, plus bonuses less penalties.", "t0": 26.7, "t1": 30.64, "shot": "r6", "visual": {"type": "doc", "source": "analyst", "kicker": "San Francisco Budget and Legislative Analyst", "text": "Budget analyst’s reconciliation", "mark": "Budget analyst’s reconciliation"}, "wt": [0.0, 0.1, 0.56, 0.93, 1.25, 1.5, 1.62, 2.44, 2.75, 3.26, 3.47]}, {"scene": "modification", "kind": "doc", "ref": ["suspicious[2]", "established[2]"], "text": "In 2014 the airport requested $1,848,174 for obsolete or worn equipment.", "t0": 30.76, "t1": 35.55, "shot": "r7", "visual": {"type": "doc", "source": "packet14", "kicker": "San Francisco Board of Supervisors", "text": "2014 equipment request", "mark": "2014 equipment request"}, "wt": [0.0, 0.13, 0.4, 0.88, 1.0, 1.37, 1.81, 2.07, 2.29, 2.56, 2.75, 3.05, 3.38, 3.55, 4.07, 4.18, 4.4]}, {"scene": "modification", "kind": "doc", "ref": ["suspicious[2]", "established[2]"], "text": "The board cut the request by $4,340 before approval.", "t0": 35.67, "t1": 39.33, "shot": "r8", "visual": {"type": "doc", "source": "final14", "kicker": "San Francisco Board of Supervisors", "text": "Resolution 328-14", "mark": "Resolution 328-14"}, "wt": [0.0, 0.14, 0.41, 0.57, 0.71, 1.12, 1.31, 1.54, 1.9, 2.13, 2.4, 2.67, 2.99, 3.27]}, {"scene": "award", "kind": "doc", "ref": ["suspicious[3]", "established[3]"], "text": "In 2019, the airport sought a separate ten-year agreement with another waiver of competition.", "t0": 39.55, "t1": 44.14, "shot": "r9", "visual": {"type": "doc", "source": "award19", "kicker": "San Francisco Board of Supervisors", "text": "2019 award", "mark": "2019 award"}, "wt": [0.0, 0.14, 0.41, 1.1, 1.23, 1.59, 1.8, 1.89, 2.25, 2.59, 3.0, 3.17, 3.57, 3.87, 3.97]}, {"scene": "award", "kind": "bignum", "ref": ["suspicious[3]", "established[3]"], "text": "The airport cited the proprietary system to explain why it sought another waiver.", "t0": 44.26, "t1": 47.82, "shot": "r10", "visual": {"type": "bignum", "value": "$219,541,698", "label": "Ten-year award"}, "wt": [0.0, 0.11, 0.5, 0.76, 0.85, 1.47, 1.78, 1.91, 2.34, 2.6, 2.71, 2.95, 3.21]}, {"scene": "award", "kind": "doc", "ref": ["suspicious[4]", "established[4]"], "text": "A consultant compared three peer systems. The airport reported availability above 99.6 percent.", "t0": 47.94, "t1": 53.25, "shot": "r11", "visual": {"type": "doc", "source": "memo19", "kicker": "San Francisco Airport Commission", "text": "Peer comparison", "mark": "Peer comparison"}, "wt": [0.0, 0.11, 0.58, 0.98, 1.22, 1.43, 2.15, 2.28, 2.65, 3.02, 3.67, 3.95, 4.45, 4.68, 4.9]}, {"scene": "award", "kind": "record", "ref": ["suspicious[4]", "established[4]"], "text": "The negotiated annual cost was $17.5 million. Staff calculated a higher average for the peer systems.", "t0": 53.37, "t1": 59.49, "shot": "r12", "visual": {"type": "record", "layout": "amounts", "context": "Annual peer comparison", "heading": "Airport price comparison", "source": "memo19", "rows": [{"icon": "money", "label": "Average peer cost", "value": "$18.7 million"}, {"icon": "money", "label": "Peer cost after adjustment", "value": "$19.5 million"}, {"icon": "money", "label": "Negotiated cost", "value": "$17.5 million"}]}, "wt": [0.0, 0.12, 0.77, 1.11, 1.42, 1.58, 2.07, 2.33, 2.62, 2.9, 3.73, 4.06, 4.6, 4.7, 4.99, 5.28, 5.41, 5.5, 5.71]}, {"scene": "award", "kind": "doc", "ref": ["suspicious[4]", "established[4]"], "text": "The analysis also presented an adjusted peer estimate of $19.5 million.", "t0": 59.61, "t1": 63.95, "shot": "r13", "visual": {"type": "doc", "source": "minutes19", "kicker": "San Francisco Airport Commission", "text": "Peer estimate after adjustment", "mark": "Peer estimate after adjustment"}, "wt": [0.0, 0.14, 0.65, 0.94, 1.38, 1.48, 1.94, 2.18, 2.54, 2.64, 3.06, 3.32, 3.62, 3.91]}, {"scene": "award", "kind": "unknowns", "ref": ["notEstablished[0]"], "text": "The settlement included training for a possible airport takeover. The records leave open whether that became practical.", "t0": 64.07, "t1": 69.39, "shot": "r14", "visual": {"type": "unknowns", "cards": ["Actual spending", "Training records"]}, "wt": [0.0, 0.12, 0.5, 0.91, 1.24, 1.38, 1.46, 1.84, 2.19, 3.09, 3.26, 3.6, 3.83, 4.09, 4.35, 4.5, 4.79]}, {"scene": "award", "kind": "end", "ref": ["status"], "text": "A lead is a question, not an accusation.", "t0": 69.51, "t1": 71.61, "shot": "r15", "visual": {"type": "end"}, "wt": [0.0, 0.14, 0.34, 0.44, 0.52, 1.16, 1.37, 1.46]}], "format": 6, "chapters": {"settlement": "From a testing accident to a service contract", "modification": "What was inside the extension?", "award": "A separate award in 2019"}, "look": "dossier", "hook": "question"}